          </constraints>
          <rules>
            <rule id="2870e207-60a5-aa00-748b" name="Crazy" hidden="false">
              <description>When attacking a sentry, the alarm is only raised on a 6, as Kage is very proficient at back-stabbing. Also he gets premonitions - sometimes they just encourage him to do bad things, but other times they warn him of danger. He has a 5+ Invulnerable save.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
